[63],{"_59":60,"_25":64},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTA3MzQwMi8zMTAxNTIwOS5wbmc=/original/pgaZBa.png","text","mediaReviewed","Screenshot source reviewed","value","2026-10-20","image","gameplay","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io game page.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/overexposed-ai.webp","alt","Overexposed’s desktop card table with newspapers, career cards, money, fame, craft, heat and an End Turn control.","https://eg30.itch.io/overexposed","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)",[88,89],"Claude Code","Codex","Related resources",[94,95],"resourceIds","section",{"_59":88,"_25":98},{"_59":96,"_25":97},"OpenAI Codex","/resources/codex/","/resources/claude-code/","Creator evidence",[102],"evidence",{"_59":103,"_25":77,"_104":105},"Read the creator’s AI contribution and asset disclosure","note","The author names Claude Code and OpenAI Codex and explains human editing of text. README confirms AI-assisted commits with Co-Authored-By trailers; CREDITS.md explains procedural pictures/effects and the separate music/font sources.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[110],{"_59":111,"_25":112,"_104":113},"Open the complete career-simulation project","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed","Complete TypeScript/React project with the rule engine, content, UI drawings, procedural sound, six music files, fonts, balance simulator and browser checks. Node.js >=22.18; npm install, npm run dev or npm run build. No explicit software license is provided, so public source availability does not establish reuse rights. Bundled fonts are OFL 1.1 and Holizna music is CC0; see CREDITS.md.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[119],{"_59":120,"_25":77,"_104":121},"Play Overexposed on itch.io","Browser playtest build, best on a landscape desktop screen. Uses mouse or touch; cards show effects on hover or long press. Begin, opening text and manager choice reached the live card desk in Chrome. The complete year, all endings and touch play were not tested; the hosted build is not claimed to match the latest repository revision.","Game platform","itch.io","Guide format","quickstart","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[129],{"_59":130,"_25":131,"_104":-7},"Read the game’s source and local run commands","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed#readme","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[136,137,138,139],"Open the itch.io browser build, choose Begin and Continue, then sign with a manager.","Select an opening card offer and inspect how the desk, resources and newspapers respond.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure, README and CREDITS.md to separate code-generated art and effects from third-party music.","Use Node.js 22.18+ with npm install and npm run dev; trace content/cards.json through core/reducer.ts and the React desk before testing a complete year.","AI workflow / foundation context","EG30 provides design, direction and writing, using Claude Code and OpenAI Codex for implementation. AI-assisted drafts of player text are edited by the creator. Art and sound effects are drawn or synthesized in code with AI assistance; the Holizna background recordings are separately credited CC0 music.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","2D","track","metadata","Asset creation tools",false,[156],"assetTools","Canvas 2D (procedural halftone art)","Engine","DOM/CSS + SVG · React UI","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[136,137,138,139],{"_59":130,"_25":131,"_17":125},{"_59":120,"_25":77,"_17":115,"_104":121},{"_59":111,"_25":112,"_172":173,"_104":113},{"_59":103,"_25":77,"_104":105},[170,171],[156],"claude-code","codex","scope","complete-project",{"_175":176},"documents",{"_177":178,"_179":180},"en",[182,186,187,188,185,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,2